# Create the Nuffield credentials secret here, from inside the devenv shell:
#   agenix edit ./aqua-credentials.age
# Paste exactly these two lines (your my.nuffieldhealth.com login), then save:
#   NUFFIELD_USERNAME=you@example.com
#   NUFFIELD_PASSWORD=your-password
# Then re-encrypt to the host keys (needs the yubikey):
#   agenix rekey
